gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=C1-FULL DIAGNOSTIC -- force every defender eligible as a block target.

// ===================================================================
// !! DIAGNOSTIC, NOT A SHIPPABLE FIX !!
// ===================================================================
// PURPOSE: prove that the block-target eligibility filter at 0x001F2D60
//   is the whole reason a CB/LB/SS in coverage can never be selected as
//   a block target (docs/block-dominance-requirements.md, C1;
//   docs/fb-wr-blocking.md Gate B; docs/lead-blocker-requirements.md).
//
// WHAT IT DOES: the filter admits a defender only if his ai_state is in
//   {2 pursuit, 30 rush/engaged, 51 authored wait} or he is human
//   (flag 0x4000). The admit path is reached by the branch
//     001F2D60  12C0000F  beq s6, zero, 0x001f2da0   (s6 = "prior admit?")
//   Forcing it ALWAYS-TAKEN makes the admit path unconditional:
//     001F2D60  1000000F  beq zero, zero, 0x001f2da0
//   Same branch target (0x001F2DA0); rs and rt both zero. Every
//   defender now enters the block-target pool regardless of state.
//
// EXPECTED (the point of the run):
//   * a previously-free CB (the blitzing corner on the misdirection
//     play; a coverage DB near a blocker) becomes a legal target and
//     gets picked up. THIS is the observation we want.
//
// KNOWN REGRESSION -- this is why it is a diagnostic, not the fix:
//   * C1-FULL is GLOBAL. Every blocker on every play now sees every
//     defender, so the five linemen may chase DBs downfield, abandon
//     the pocket, and draw ineligible-man-downfield. Watch for it; it
//     is EXPECTED and is exactly what the scoped fix (C1b) exists to
//     avoid. Confirm the CB becomes blockable, then we build C1b.
//
// ISOLATION (rule 2): this file is C1 ALONE. Deploy it BY ITSELF (not
//   combined with the t3-live double-team set) so the observation is
//   unconfounded. The double-team fix is a different code path and can
//   be re-deployed after.
//
// REVERT: delete the file (or restore t3-live.pnach) + reboot the VM.
//   In-place code word, patch=1 so it re-applies after load_state.
// ===================================================================

patch=1,EE,001F2D60,word,1000000F
